{"id": "tatoeba-ja-0000", "text": "それはあなたが一人になりたくないからです。", "lang": "ja", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ja-0001", "text": "そんなつもりではなかったんだ。", "lang": "ja", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ja-0002", "text": "愛してる。", "lang": "ja", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ja-0003", "text": "「いつ戻りますか」「天候次第です」", "lang": "ja", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ja-0004", "text": "「洞穴の中で何が起こっているんだろう？すごく知りたいなあ」「見当もつかないよ」", "lang": "ja", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ja-0005", "text": "「彼女は音楽が好きだ」「私もそうだ」", "lang": "ja", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ja-0006", "text": "「ええ、オレンジジュースをお願いします」マイクは言った。", "lang": "ja", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ja-0007", "text": "「もし疲れているなら寝たらどう？」「僕が今寝たらあまりに早く目覚めてしまうから」", "lang": "ja", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ja-0008", "text": "「おわったの」「それどころかまだ始めていないよ」", "lang": "ja", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ja-0009", "text": "私たちはもう終わったわ。指輪を返して！", "lang": "ja", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ja-0010", "text": "「ありがとう」「どういたしまして」", "lang": "ja", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ja-0011", "text": "彼が死んだことは言伝に知りました。", "lang": "ja", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ja-0012", "text": "専門ガッコのタメだよ。", "lang": "ja", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ja-0013", "text": "会場に着くと早速担当者に「この絵は将来必ず値が上がる」などとしつこく言われ、契約書にサインしてしまった。", "lang": "ja", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ja-0014", "text": "雨がひどく降ったのでグラウンドはぐしゃぐしゃだ。", "lang": "ja", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ja-0015", "text": "ペールエールはアルコール含有量の少ないビールだ。", "lang": "ja", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ja-0016", "text": "ニューススタンドで聞いて下さい。", "lang": "ja", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ja-0017", "text": "できるだけ安くあげようとした。", "lang": "ja", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ja-0018", "text": "スキーをしたら、足を骨折したんだ。", "lang": "ja", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ja-0019", "text": "コーヒー通の人達に結構評判がいいそうです。", "lang": "ja", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
